OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy but dry to start the     
OL,6,Fday. Light outbreaks of rain reaching  
OL,7,Fwestern counties by the afternoon,     
OL,8,Fwhile eastern parts remain dry.        
OL,9,FFeeling chilly with a brisk            
OL,10,Fsoutheasterly wind, stronger along the 
OL,11,Fcoast.                                 
OL,13,CTonight:FCold and cloudy for most      
OL,14,Fareas, although breaks do develop      
OL,15,Fmostly across eastern parts allowing a 
OL,16,Fground frost to form. Remaining breezy 
OL,17,Falong the coast.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
