OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry start to the weekend,  
OL,6,Fwith some sunnier spells across the    
OL,7,Ffar east. Soon clouding over, with     
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain, turning heavy by    
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. A strong southeasterly  
OL,10,Fwind.                                  
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMorning 
OL,13,Frain clearing, with sunshine to follow 
OL,14,Fon Sunday. Cloudy but dry on Monday. A 
OL,15,Fband of rain moves in later Tuesday.   
OL,16,FAbove average temperatures for the     
OL,17,Ftime of year.                          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
